WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.818 --> 00:00:10.784
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Vienna left Italy in April twenty twenty-two

2
00:00:10.923 --> 00:00:14.448
and when I spoke to her again, she was in Kazakhstan.

3
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:18.962
By December twenty twenty-four, she hoped to reach Mongolia,

4
00:00:19.055 --> 00:00:21.923
where the true story of Marco Polo began.

5
00:00:22.232 --> 00:00:26.252
We asked her if she had any plans for more travelling, and she said,

6
00:00:26.329 --> 00:00:31.439
‘In the future, I’d like to travel round the world. But nothing is certain.’